"accessibility":{"accessibilityData":{"label":"Show more"}},"simpleText":"...more"},"showLessText":{"simpleText":"Show less"},"attributedDescriptionBodyText":{"content":"#FantasyPremierLeague #PremierLeague #football \n\nChris and Nathan from ‪@TheExtraInch‬ join us to talk all things Tottenham for FPL, and one sleeper pick to keep an eye on.\n\nCome join us! 🔗  / aboveaveragefpl  \nCheck out Solio Analytics 🔗https://fpl.solioanalytics.com/abovea...\n\nTimestamps:\n\nCredit to:\nMotion Design 🔗 https://shawbird.webflow.io\nOverlays/Thumbnails 🔗https://x.com/AlexVolloFPL\n\nIf you wished to support Baker running the 2027 London Marathon in aid of Cancer Research: https://fundraise.cancerresearchuk.or...\n\nAll our Links:\n\n🔗http://bit.ly/AAFPLApple\n🔗http://bit.ly/AAFPLSpotify\n🔗https://bit.ly/AAFPLWebsite","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":0,"length":21,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CCcQ3NcEGEMiEwjQrY-J86uWAxXkgIoHHaKKKwvKAQQ8OlM2","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/hashtag/fantasypremierleague","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_BROWSE","rootVe":6827,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/browse"}},"browseEndpoint":{"browseId":"FEhashtag","params":"6gUYChRmYW50YXN5cHJlbWllcmxlYWd1ZRgB"}}},"loggingDirectives":{"trackingParams":"CCcQ3NcEGEMiEwjQrY-J86uWAxXkgIoHHaKKKws="}},{"startIndex":22,"length":14,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CCYQ3NcEGEQiEwjQrY-J86uWAxXkgIoHHaKKKwvKAQQ8OlM2","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/hashtag/premierleague","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_BROWSE","rootVe":6827,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/browse"}},"browseEndpoint":{"browseId":"FEhashtag","params":"6gURCg1wcmVtaWVybGVhZ3VlGAE%3D"}}},"loggingDirectives":{"trackingParams":"CCYQ3NcEGEQiEwjQrY-J86uWAxXkgIoHHaKKKws="}},{"startIndex":37,"length":9,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CCUQ3NcEGEUiEwjQrY-J86uWAxXkgIoHHaKKKwvKAQQ8OlM2","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/hashtag/football","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_BROWSE","rootVe"